{"unit_id":"tag:06PI:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n后面将看到，一个光滑（smooth）的<MATH_0001>-空间（space）对群（group）代数空间（algebraic space）<MATH_0002>的商叠（quotient stack）是光滑（smooth）的，即使<MATH_0003>并不光滑（smooth）\n（《叠（Stacks）的态射（Morphisms）》引理\n<REF_0001>）。\n\n\n\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"space","target_term":"空间"},{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"quotient stack","target_term":"商叠"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"Stacks","target_term":"叠"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"作用空间、群代数空间及商叠的光滑性；待批准。"},{"source_term":"space","target_term":"空间","context":"底概形上的作用空间；待批准。"},{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群","context":"代数空间中的群对象；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"群代数空间；待批准。"},{"source_term":"quotient stack","target_term":"商叠","context":"群作用商叠；待批准。"},{"source_term":"Stacks","target_term":"叠","context":"章节名称核心；待批准。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"章节名称核心；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:076U:title","translation":"平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）拓扑（topology）中的代数栈（Algebraic stacks）","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"Algebraic stacks","target_term":"代数栈"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"平展拓扑；保留原重音token；待批准。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"本节的平展拓扑；待批准。"},{"source_term":"Algebraic stacks","target_term":"代数栈","context":"平展站点上的代数栈；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:076U:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。我们也可不在大fppf站点（site）<MATH_0002>上研究取值于群胚（groupoids）的叠（stacks），\n而是在大平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）站点（site）<MATH_0003>上研究取值于群胚（groupoids）的叠（stacks）。\n《代数栈（Algebraic Stacks）》第\n<REF_0001>、\n<REF_0002>、\n<REF_0003>、\n<REF_0004>、\n<REF_0005>、\n<REF_0006>、\n<REF_0007>和\n<REF_0008>节中的全部内容\n对<MATH_0004>上的群胚（groupoids）纤维范畴（categories）都有意义。\n因此，在平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）拓扑（topology）中研究可得到代数栈（algebraic stack）的第二种概念。\n这一概念先验地比《代数栈（Algebraic Stacks）》定义<REF_0009>\n引入的概念弱，因为fppf拓扑（topology）中的叠（stack）当然也是平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）\n拓扑（topology）中的叠（stack）。但是，这些概念等价（equivalent），如下引理所示。\n\n","allowed_english":["fppf"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"站点"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"stacks","target_term":"叠"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"站点"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"stacks","target_term":"叠"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数栈"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"algebraic stack","target_term":"代数栈"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数栈"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"stack","target_term":"叠"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"stack","target_term":"叠"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"底概形；待批准。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"站点","context":"大fppf或大平展站点；待批准。"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚","context":"叠及纤维范畴的取值；待批准。"},{"source_term":"stacks","target_term":"叠","context":"大站点上的群胚叠；待批准。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"大平展站点与平展拓扑；保留原重音token；待批准。"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数栈","context":"章节引用；待批准。"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"群胚纤维范畴；待批准。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"平展或fppf拓扑；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic stack","target_term":"代数栈","context":"平展定义的代数栈；待批准。"},{"source_term":"stack","target_term":"叠","context":"两种拓扑中的叠；待批准。"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价","context":"两种代数栈概念等价；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:076V:statement","translation":"以<MATH_0003>表示<MATH_0001>\n和<MATH_0002>共同的底层范畴（underlying category）（参见\n《叠（Stacks）上的层（Sheaves）》第<REF_0001>节及\n《拓扑（Topologies）》注记<REF_0002>）。设<MATH_0004>为\n<MATH_0005>的对象（object）。设\n<MATH_0006>\n为满足以下性质的群胚纤维范畴（category fibred in groupoids）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002><MATH_0007>为<MATH_0008>上的取值于群胚（groupoids）的叠（stack），\n<STRUCT_0003>对角态射（diagonal）<MATH_0009>\n可由代数空间（algebraic spaces）表示（representable）<FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>这里既可指平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）拓扑（topology）中的层（sheaves），其对角态射（diagonal）可表（representable），且有一个概形（scheme）给出的平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）满射（surjective）覆盖（covering）；也可指\n《代数空间（Algebraic Spaces）》定义<REF_0003>\n所定义的代数空间（algebraic spaces）。\n具体说来，由《逐步构造》引理<REF_0004>，\n二者没有区别。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>，以及\n<STRUCT_0004>存在<MATH_0010>\n及<MATH_0011>-态射（morphism）<MATH_0012>，\n它满射（surjective）且光滑（smooth）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n则<MATH_0013>是《代数栈（Algebraic Stacks）》定义<REF_0005>\n意义下的代数栈（algebraic stack）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"underlying category","target_term":"底层范畴"},{"source_term":"Stacks","target_term":"叠"},{"source_term":"Sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"category fibred in groupoids","target_term":"群胚纤维范畴"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚"},{"source_term":"stack","target_term":"叠"},{"source_term":"diagonal","target_term":"对角态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"表示"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"diagonal","target_term":"对角态射"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数栈"},{"source_term":"algebraic stack","target_term":"代数栈"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"underlying category","target_term":"底层范畴","context":"fppf和平展站点的共同底层范畴；待批准。"},{"source_term":"Stacks","target_term":"叠","context":"章节名称核心；待批准。"},{"source_term":"Sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"章节名称核心；待批准。"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"章节引用；待批准。"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"站点中的底概形对象；待批准。"},{"source_term":"category fibred in groupoids","target_term":"群胚纤维范畴","context":"待判定为代数栈的纤维范畴；待批准。"},{"source_term":"groupoids","target_term":"群胚","context":"叠的取值；待批准。"},{"source_term":"stack","target_term":"叠","context":"平展站点上的叠；待批准。"},{"source_term":"diagonal","target_term":"对角态射","context":"叠及层的对角态射；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"两种定义的代数空间；待批准。"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"表示","context":"叠的对角可表；待批准。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"平展拓扑与平展图册；保留原重音token；待批准。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"平展拓扑；待批准。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"平展拓扑中的层；待批准。"},{"source_term":"representable","target_term":"可表","context":"层的对角可表；待批准。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"代数空间平展图册；待批准。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"图册满射性；待批准。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"平展图册覆盖；待批准。"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"章节引用；待批准。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"光滑图册1-态射；待批准。"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"图册光滑性；待批准。"},{"source_term":"Algebraic Stacks","target_term":"代数栈","context":"章节引用；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic stack","target_te